<title>GHANA: SOCCER-GHANA AND MOROCCO DRAW 2-2 ON WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GHANA AND MOROCCO DRAW 2-2 ON WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KUMASI, Ghana 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ghana and Morocco drew 2-2</p>
<p>(halftime 0-1) in a World Cup African zone, group five</p>
<p>qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ghana - Sam Johnson 85, Emmanuel Osei Kuffuor 90</p>
<p>Morocco - Basr Hadjim 41, Hadji Mustapha 80</p>
<p>Attendance: 80,000</p>
</text>
